<%- include('header') %><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A NEW HOME</span><h1>领养管理</h1><p><%= animal.animalCode %> · 为它寻找合适的新家</p></div><a class="button" href="/animals/<%= animal._id %>">返回详情</a></div><div class="form-layout"><section class="panel"><h2>领养人登记</h2><form method="dialog" data-preview="领养登记"><div class="form-grid"><label>领养人姓名 <em>*</em><input name="adopterName" value="<%= adoption ? adoption.adopterName : '' %>" placeholder="填写领养人姓名" required maxlength="80"></label><label>联系电话 <em>*</em><input type="tel" name="adopterPhone" value="<%= adoption ? adoption.adopterPhone : '' %>" required maxlength="30" placeholder="填写领养人电话"></label><label class="full">备注<textarea name="remarks" rows="5" maxlength="2000" placeholder="记录需要补充的领养信息"><%= adoption ? adoption.remarks : '' %></textarea></label></div><%- include('form-actions', { cancelUrl: '/animals/' + animal._id, submitLabel: '预览领养登记' }) %></form></section><aside class="panel form-aside"><span class="aside-symbol">⌂</span><h2>领养进度</h2><span class="badge status-<%= animal.adoptionStatus %>"><%= labels.adoptionStatuses[animal.adoptionStatus] %></span><p>确认安置和健康情况后开放领养，登记领养人，再完成交接结案。</p><form method="dialog" data-preview="开放领养状态"><button type="submit">预览开放领养</button><div class="form-feedback" role="status" hidden></div></form><form method="dialog" data-preview="撤回开放领养" class="spaced"><button type="submit">预览撤回开放</button><div class="form-feedback" role="status" hidden></div></form><a class="button primary spaced" href="/animals/<%= animal._id %>/close">进入结案页面 →</a></aside></div><%- include('footer') %>
